                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1b75a479-57d4-44f5-bdbf-d9dbcf72500a",
                        "entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "increvables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e335a302-e836-3372-9dfc-9be1ccfffcc4",
                        "entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut pas se crever."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f3d21e4-47cd-4d70-8d3a-ff81e138ef53",
                                "sense_id": "e335a302-e836-3372-9dfc-9be1ccfffcc4",
                                "text": "Brevet de quinze ans, 30 septembre 1913; Destriez (J.) & Duthilleul (E.), représentés par Smits, rue Colbrant, n\" 23, à Lille (Nord). — Tube à air increvable et inéclatable remplaçant la chambre à air des pneumatiques pour automobiles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6b4a789-4a0f-31b5-ac94-3fbab294a36d",
                        "entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut pas mourir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "En parlant des personnes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fb2b7a7-00e9-443c-ae7a-1f9b3701836e",
                                "sense_id": "e6b4a789-4a0f-31b5-ac94-3fbab294a36d",
                                "text": "D’autre part j’avais mon roman de tête, je veux dire : un rêve organisé, bien construit, bien enchaîné, interminable comme ces films à épisodes où renaissent miraculeusement d’increvables héros."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eff53fbd-d0da-3916-bc46-0eecf5899fa3",
                        "entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Très résistant, très solide, robuste ; infatigable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "En parlant d’un animé ou d’un inanimé"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae8eac9a-48c7-4c7b-994c-703ec72afa3b",
                                "sense_id": "eff53fbd-d0da-3916-bc46-0eecf5899fa3",
                                "text": "Messires les rats jouissent d’une telle notoriété depuis les temps héroïques de la Batrachomyomachie , qu'il est inutile de vous décrire les mœurs et raconter les prouesses de cette increvable race."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d4bb111-fadf-4c3c-ad1f-5b536a6368af",
                                "sense_id": "eff53fbd-d0da-3916-bc46-0eecf5899fa3",
                                "text": "La vieille Coccinelle était increvable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4661481-dfcd-3a40-9adb-5675da840146",
                        "entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "En qui on peut avoir la plus grande confiance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "En parlant d’un renseignement"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0eb7c403-8b3a-4303-a132-be7cb4b7bcc1",
                                "sense_id": "b4661481-dfcd-3a40-9adb-5675da840146",
                                "text": "Benoit-Migette, qui a toujours un pied dans les journaux de sport et l’autre dans l’antichambre du juge d’instruction, déclara posséder un tuyau admirable, increvable, et l’ignoble Mouchin lui donna deux cents francs à ponter sur Coriolan !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbd0ccb8-6100-4e53-bc41-4284e26b34d5",
                                "sense_id": "b4661481-dfcd-3a40-9adb-5675da840146",
                                "text": "Il était chargé aussi de remplacer, aussitôt mortes de langueur, les petites tortues caparaçonnées d’argent et de turquoises dont les dames s’ornaient alors ; et de jouer à Auteuil les bons tuyaux, les increvables."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a79bdff-277f-44cb-99f2-5b0c1253f71c",
                        "source_entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "e335a302-e836-3372-9dfc-9be1ccfffcc4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui ne peut se crever.",
                        "target_lang_word": "inforabile",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbaf5cbd-bfdb-4825-88c0-e39a8af79c02",
                        "source_entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "e6b4a789-4a0f-31b5-ac94-3fbab294a36d",
                        "target_lang_word": "unstoppable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unstoppable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                        "entry_id": "d52897ee-1f2e-359f-9a15-bfe9bc4238ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unable to be stopped."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "087e0ab7-614d-4611-820b-d010934c91e1",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "Their \"greatly unstoppable fight\" against the cause was a joke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "162aead1-59c4-4e01-a674-14d6cc39fa93",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "In these early days of silent pictures, the accent was chiefly on thrills and danger as provided by supposedly unstoppable locomotives with crooks or maniacs on the footplate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77d75dd2-0210-4443-852a-b8e96b66ac17",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "However Russian Pavlyuchenko stunned his compatriots with an unstoppable 25-yard drive into the top corner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de8c845-2eab-45b5-a930-23070b56aca1",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "I'm so powerful / I don't need batteries to play / I'm so confident / Yeah, I'm unstoppable today"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec603c51-5806-4a4a-9ab1-c851a054f616",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "20 January 2017, Donald Trump, Inauguration Speech\nWhen America is united, America is totally unstoppable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93db8a2c-6796-4f64-9f87-7a401aa5bdc9",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "These trains were ordered years before the pandemic, commissioned to tackle a problem that has (for now) gone away. Passenger numbers are no longer increasing at an unstoppable rate, driven by rising central London employment. The extra capacity is not currently needed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc31ddc9-8dc2-446a-a369-0b9c0ebaad9b",
                        "source_entry_id": "5193465f-a870-382b-b7d0-cc38018dcb3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "e6b4a789-4a0f-31b5-ac94-3fbab294a36d",
                        "target_lang_word": "undying",
